From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] gdi32, win32u: logical colour spaces, ICM mode and profile per DC

CreateColorSpace/DeleteColorSpace/GetColorSpace/SetColorSpace,
GetLogColorSpace, SetICMProfile/GetICMProfile and SetICMMode now work: a new
GDI object type holds the LOGCOLORSPACEW, every DC starts with a system sRGB
colour space, SelectObject and SaveDC/RestoreDC handle it, and the ICM mode
and output profile are per-DC state. EMF playback creates colour spaces and
sets ICM profiles. Four new syscalls (win32syscalls.h regenerated); two
todo_wine marks removed from the icm test. CORE: integrator must review
(patches/notes/5203.txt).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
---

diff --git a/include/ntgdi.h b/include/ntgdi.h
--- a/include/ntgdi.h
+++ b/include/ntgdi.h
@@ -72,6 +72,7 @@
 #define NTGDI_OBJ_PAL             0x080000
 #define NTGDI_OBJ_BITMAP          0x090000
 #define NTGDI_OBJ_FONT            0x0a0000
+#define NTGDI_OBJ_COLORSPACE      0x0b0000  /* Wine value; native uses 0x09 */
 #define NTGDI_OBJ_BRUSH           0x100000
 #define NTGDI_OBJ_PEN             0x300000
 #define NTGDI_OBJ_EXTPEN          0x500000
@@ -272,6 +273,7 @@
 W32KAPI HBITMAP  WINAPI NtGdiCreateBitmap( INT width, INT height, UINT planes,
                                            UINT bpp, const void *bits );
 W32KAPI HANDLE   WINAPI NtGdiCreateClientObj( ULONG type );
+W32KAPI HCOLORSPACE WINAPI NtGdiCreateColorSpace( const LOGCOLORSPACEW *cs );
 W32KAPI HBITMAP  WINAPI NtGdiCreateCompatibleBitmap( HDC hdc, INT width, INT height );
 W32KAPI HDC      WINAPI NtGdiCreateCompatibleDC( HDC hdc );
 W32KAPI HBRUSH   WINAPI NtGdiCreateDIBBrush( const void *data, UINT coloruse, UINT size,
@@ -441,6 +443,9 @@
                                                         UINT coloruse, UINT max_bits, UINT max_info,
                                                         BOOL xform_coords, HANDLE xform );
 W32KAPI BOOL     WINAPI NtGdiSetDeviceGammaRamp( HDC hdc, void *ptr );
+W32KAPI HCOLORSPACE WINAPI NtGdiSetColorSpace( HDC hdc, HCOLORSPACE cs );
+W32KAPI INT      WINAPI NtGdiSetIcmMode( HDC hdc, INT mode );
+W32KAPI BOOL     WINAPI NtGdiSetIcmProfile( HDC hdc, const WCHAR *filename );
 W32KAPI DWORD    WINAPI NtGdiSetLayout( HDC hdc, LONG wox, DWORD layout );
 W32KAPI BOOL     WINAPI NtGdiSetMagicColors( HDC hdc, DWORD magic, ULONG index );
 W32KAPI INT      WINAPI NtGdiSetMetaRgn( HDC hdc );
